Subject: [PATCH] feat(settings): autostart apps

Port of pctrade/end4-pC dc2ca2600ee6: scripts/hyprland/autostart.py, modules/common/widgets/AutostartApps.qml, shell.qml (autostart launcher)
https://github.com/pctrade/end4-pC/tree/dc2ca2600ee6d7852bf0ac91361db8e510f90a74
Problem: apps to launch once per session are a shell choice kept in config.json (hyprland.autostartApps), so the shell needs its own launcher and lock instead of Hyprland's exec-once.
Port: hand-ported (lock moved to $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR; venv shebang; launcher and the widget's manual run button call the script directly, not through python3 from PATH)
Drop when: autostart apps are configured some other way.
